{#
  Jonson CTA beat — the ways-to-connect moment inside a response ([[contact]]).
  One button routing to /contact, tuned for the olive slab. Its label is fixed —
  "Let’s talk more" — for everyone, VIP or not: it follows a reply that has just
  made the case, so it continues the conversation rather than asking the contact
  single's question again (that copy stays on the contact page and panel).

  Expects: contact — the contact single entry.
#}
{% if contact is defined and contact %}
    <div class="c-ctas c-ctas--jonson">
        {% include '_components/button.twig' with {
            label: 'Let’s talk more',
            href:  siteUrl('contact'),
            size:  'md',
        } only %}
    </div>
{% endif %}
